                    },
                    "message": "can you also explain what is UA ? and what is UA_T2 before any of this ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "UA_T2 is part of the `Timing Specification` in the PLDM FW Update Specification. \n\nUA is the update agent which orchestrates the firmware update to the devices"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ManojKiran Eda",
                        "email": "manojkiran.eda@gmail.com",
                        "username": "manojkiraneda"
                    },
                    "message": "can you put this in the commit message as well please ?"
                },
