                        "name": "ManojKiran Eda",
                        "email": "manojkiran.eda@gmail.com",
                        "username": "manojkiraneda"
                    },
                    "message": "probably worth to make this an integer option with a min and max, and set it to min (with a rationale), so that other companies could tweak if they want to ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/device_updater.hpp",
                    "line": 242,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "Ack, I've added a meson option to address this. I've set it to 60s as the min based on the PLDM spec"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/device_updater.hpp",
